---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Notes
description: Practical notes on building and running software with AI — written from what actually happened, including the parts that went wrong.
permalink: /blog/
---

<section class="v3-pagehero">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    <h1>Notes</h1>
    <p class="v3-pagehero__lead">What we've learned building and running software with AI —
    written from real projects, including the parts that went wrong.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v3-prose">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <article style="padding:1.75rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--v3-surface,#e2e2ee);">
        <p class="v3-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        </p>
        <h2 style="margin:.2rem 0 .5rem;font-size:1.5rem;">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p>Nothing here yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
